CowSwapModuleFactory_Constructor
├── when cowSettlement is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_ZeroCowSettlement
├── when cowSettlement has no code
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_SettlementNotContract
├── when the sequencer uptime feed is non-zero and has no deployed code
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_SequencerFeedNotContract
├── when the sequencer uptime feed is zero
│   ├── when the grace period is non-zero
│   │   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_GracePeriodWithoutFeed
│   └── when the grace period is zero
│       └── it should deploy for the L1 profile
├── when the sequencer uptime feed is a contract
│   ├── when the grace period is zero
│   │   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_InvalidGracePeriod
│   ├── when the grace period exceeds the maximum
│   │   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_InvalidGracePeriod
│   ├── when the grace period equals the maximum
│   │   └── it should deploy
│   └── when the grace period is any value in range
│       ├── it should accept every value in (0, MAX_SEQUENCER_GRACE_PERIOD]
│       └── it should reject every value above MAX_SEQUENCER_GRACE_PERIOD
└── when cowSettlement is a valid contract
    ├── it should set cowSettlement
    ├── it should set sequencerUptimeFeed
    └── it should set sequencerGracePeriod
